25-06-05T14:14:03Z","body":"> Yeah I think this was a review oversight but such a refactoring PR should never have included actual logic changes. These should be reverted.\n\nIt indeed shouldn't have. I believe what happened was that PR also integrated some existing macros into the `Math` namespace to remove redundancy, as the majority of cases *were* semantic; this must've been erroneously included in that batch, overlooked because of `INF` as its name","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2944636134/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]